      <title>LSMSA Temporarily Transitions to Online Instruction</title>
                                                                                                                                    
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <link>https://www.lsmsa.edu/page/news-detail?pk=1671745&amp;nc=20751&amp;fromId=249284</link>
                                                                                                                                    
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <description>NATCHITOCHES, LA. – The Louisiana School for Math, Science, and the Arts (LSMSA) will transition to online instruction for two weeks, beginning Wednesday, March 25, and continuing through Thursday, April 2. There will be no classes on March 23 and 24 to allow students time to return home and prepare for remote learning. Spring Break will take place as scheduled from Friday, April 3, through Sunday, April 12. The dormitories are currently projected to reopen on Sunday, April 12, so that in-person classes may resume on April 13.</description>
                                                                                                                                    
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
